# WARSZAWASZA · Protocol v1.0

Docs: [`docs/protocol/critique-protocol-v1.md`](../../docs/protocol/critique-protocol-v1.md) · [`docs/identity/miejski-operator.md`](../../docs/identity/miejski-operator.md)

## Rule 0 (first, non-negotiable)

**Every abstraction must reduce cognitive resistance. Otherwise remove it.**  
(Każda abstrakcja musi zmniejszać opór poznawczy. W przeciwnym razie usuń.)

## Critique ● Continuous

Before approving changes, run five questions and check **Failure**:

| | Question | Failure |
|---|----------|---------|
| 👦 Oluś | Czy to ma sens? | Model > reality; abstraction replaced observation |
| 👔 Tomek | Czy wiem, po co to jest? | Architecture > user; first minute ≠ action |
| 🚜 Dziadek | Czy to działa? | Workshop OK, field fail |
| 👵 Babcia | Czy to służy ludziom? | Metrics optimized, life not improved |
| 🦅 Orzeł | A co, jeśli zmienimy skalę? | Local optimization breaks whole system |

**Reality:** if reality disagrees, the model changes — not reality.

## Also

- Model = record enabling return to reality; ends where life begins.
- System registers, correlates, remembers — no human intent attributed to it.
- Field test everything: code, SQL, UI.

Good design saves effort **without** removing agency. *Humans decide.*
